# The app menu's "Aim speed" (wish of the project owner, 30.10.2026: the Controls page, beside "Invert vertical",
# for aiming the knife and the guns by touch or a controller, not by the gyro): the stick's turn while aiming is
# multiplied by runtime/aim_options.cpp's factor (0.5 .. 3, 1 as the game). PlWepLockCtrl (the guns, the knife
# stance, the bow; pitch blend m3r, waist yaw m_Fwork0 and the body's turn at the waist limit) and the scope
# (CameraScope::move: body yaw and scope pitch, the zoom's gain kept). The D-pad's fixed steps stay as they are.
# With the factor 1 (the default) nothing changes. "Invert vertical" is the game's own CFG_AIM_REVERSE.
--- a/src/game/pl_wep.cpp
+++ b/src/game/pl_wep.cpp
